NOTE ON SCOPE

ChainCert is an academic capstone project, not production software. It is
published for reference and study. See LIMITATIONS.md for the known security
and design constraints that were accepted deliberately within capstone scope.
Do not deploy it as-is to handle real credentials without addressing them.

Third-party components retain their own licenses. Hyperledger Fabric sample
material under backend/node_creation/ derives from the upstream fabric-samples
project (Apache License 2.0). Design reference material under
docs/design-reference/ is third-party and is included for reference only.
